DESCRIPTION:💃 SALSA CLASSES ARE BACK THIS SEPTEMBER! Our next 6-week Sa
 lsa series starts September 8 & 10 at the Larcom Theatre. Choose Tuesday o
 r Thursday nights and the class that fits your experience level. BEGINNER 
 1A — FOUNDATIONS Tuesdays at 7:25 PM or Thursdays at 6:20 PM Brand new t
 o Salsa? Start here! Learn On 2 timing\, basic steps\, partner connection
 \, turns\, cross-body leads\, and foundational patterns. No previous exper
 ience necessary. BEGINNER 1B — ESSENTIALS Tuesdays at 6:20 PM or Thursda
 ys at 8:30 PM Ready for the next step? Build on the foundations from 1A wh
 ile improving timing\, connection\, leading and following technique\, tran
 sitions\, musicality\, and beginner patterns. Completion of Beginner 1A or
  equivalent experience is required. COUPLES BEGINNER 1B Tuesdays at 8:30 P
 M Want to learn together without rotating partners? This class is designed
  specifically for couples. Stay with the partner you came with while build
 ing connection\, technique\, smoother transitions\, and expanded Beginner 
 1B patterns. Beginner 1A or equivalent experience required. 6 weeks. One n
 ight a week. Lots of Salsa. We extend a special invitation for ‘leads’
  to join\, as their participation will help ensure a robust presence of po
 tential partner leads. ​ Grab your spot and join us on the dance floor t
 his September! Thelarcom.org/learnsalsa For questions about the class\, em
 ail: donnie@thelarcom.org LARCOM THEATRE\, 13 Wallis St\, Beverly MA\n\nSo
 urces: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofboston.org/event/latin-
 night-learn-salsa-dance-lessons/2026-09-15/
LOCATION:Larcom Theatre\, 13 Wallis Street\, Beverly\, MA\, 01915
