  finding oneself within cultural heteronormativity and amidst the pressure
 s of everyday life. This show proposes queerness as a driving force of emp
 owerment through play\, revelation\, and dérive\, felt in flickers of war
 mth where time and space move differently.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEv
