BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Anthony Gomes – Praise Out Loud 2026 Tour
DTSTART:20260919T200000
DTEND:20260919T220000
DTSTAMP:20260914T170850Z
UID:f79279e5f006acff8abaf22953ec1a@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:With a guitar slung over his shoulder and the amps turned up f
 ull tilt\, Anthony Gomes electrifies blues and rock at a 21st century cros
 sroads of his own. The Canadian vocalist\, guitarist\, songwriter\, and pr
 oducer wails with all the force of a hurricane in the Mississippi Delta an
 d enough fret-burning fireworks to leave his strings in flames. Over the y
 ears\, he’s toppled the Billboard Blues Chart at #1\, earned the endorse
 ment of legends such as B.B. King\, tallied tens of millions of streams\, 
 and packed shows on multiple continents. Named one of Total Guitar magazin
 e’s “100 Greatest Blues Guitarists of All Time” and recognized by Gu
 itar World among the world’s best blues guitarists\, Gomes has become on
 e of today’s most exciting live performers. In 2026\, Gomes is back supp
 orting his #1 blues album\, Praise the Loud\, with a world tour that inclu
 des stops in 17 countries. Expect a powerhouse night featuring blistering 
 guitar solos\, soulful vocals\, and a high-energy blend of blues\, classic
  rock\, and modern rock that has earned him a devoted international follow
 ing. Thelarcom.org/anthonygomes\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: h
 ttps://northofboston.org/event/anthony-gomes-praise-out-loud-2026-tour/
LOCATION:Larcom Theatre\, 13 Wallis Street\, Beverly\, MA\, 01915
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/anthony-gomes-praise-out-loud-2026-tou
 r/
END:VEVENT
