 Time (US & Canada) Oct 2\, 2026\, 7:00pm to 9:00pm Timezone: Eastern Time 
 (US & Canada) Oct 4\, 2026\, 7:00pm to 9:00pm Timezone: Eastern Time (US &
  Canada)\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofboston.or
 g/event/manhattan-short-film-festival-3/2026-10-02/1/
LOCATION:Shalin Liu Performance Center\, 37 Main Street\, Rockport\, MA\, 
 01966
