UID:dd6d7b40503909ebc20b10d98345d3@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Join Discover Marblehead & Marblehead Museum for the 7th Annua
 l Fall Fair on Saturday\, October 3rd from 10:00am – 3:00pm in the Lee M
 ansion Garden! It’s sure to be a fun day with an amazing line-up of 21 a
 rtist vendors selling their beautiful work\, Acorn Gallery art students dr
 awing portraits\, and Shaken & Served serving up delicious beverages! As a
 lways\, we will be selling Pumpkin Decorating Kits and donating all the pr
 oceeds to Marblehead Food Pantry. This event is rain or shine. If there is
  weather\, we will be inside the Lee Mansion. FREE admission. Come out and
  get an early start on your holiday shopping!\n\nSources: North of Boston
 \nEvent page: https://northofboston.org/event/fall-fair/
