DTEND:20261010T180000
DTSTAMP:20260914T170850Z
UID:588d1be8af29d8e6d8dcfc04efdda8@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Northshore Horror & Anime Fest returns to Danvers\, Massachuse
 tts\, October 10–11\, 2026\, for a full weekend celebrating horror\, ani
 me\, cosplay\, comics\, collectibles\, gaming\, and Halloween fun. Located
  just minutes from Salem during the heart of Halloween season\, the event 
 features celebrity guests\, voice actors\, comic book artists\, authors\, 
 cosplayers\, filmmakers\, vendors\, collectibles\, toys\, comics\, anime m
 erchandise\, Pokémon and trading cards\, panels\, Q&As\, screenings\, pho
 to opportunities\, costume contests\, giveaways\, interactive attractions
 \, and more. Saturday features the Adult Costume Contest\, while Sunday in
 cludes family-friendly activities\, a Kids Costume Contest\, and Trick-or-
 Treating throughout the vendor marketplace. Kids 12 and under are free\, a
 nd parking is free. 📅 October 10–11\, 2026 📍 Danvers Indoor Sports
 \, 150R Andover Street\, Danvers\, MA 🎃 Minutes from Salem\, Massachuse
 tts Whether you’re a horror fan\, anime lover\, collector\, cosplayer\, 
 gamer\, or simply looking for something fun to do during Halloween season
 \, Northshore Horror & Anime Fest has something for everyone.\n\nSources: 
 North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofboston.org/event/northshore-ho
 rror-anime-fest/2026-10-10/
LOCATION:Danvers Indoor Sports 150r Andover St Danver\, MA 01923\, 150R An
 dover St\, Danvers\, MA\, 01923
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/northshore-horror-anime-fest/2026-10-1
 0/
