UID:5d69e8d6c554e2a7b9a7a9ab141f87@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Everybody Wants Some is the ultimate Van Halen tribute band\, 
 electrifying audiences across the Northeast since 2016. Formerly known as 
 Eruption—and even featured on Boston’s legendary 107.3 WAAF—they’v
 e earned a reputation as the premier classic Van Halen experience.​ From
  Eddie’s blazing guitar solos to David Lee Roth’s wild stage energy\, 
 this band nails the look\, sound\, and attitude of Van Halen’s golden er
 a (1978–1984). Every show is a high-octane\, hard-rocking celebration th
 at transports fans back to their first live Van Halen concert. If you love
  classic Van Halen\, Everybody Wants Some is a must-see. Crank it up\, fee
 l the energy\, and get ready to party like it’s 1984! Thelarcom.org/ever
 ybodywantssome\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofbos
 ton.org/event/everybody-wants-some-4/
