DESCRIPTION:Raised as an elf at the North Pole\, Buddy travels to New York
  City in search of his real family—and discovers a world that could use 
 a little more Christmas spirit. Filled with laughter\, heart\, and holiday
  cheer\, Elf is a beloved comedy the whole family will enjoy.\n\nSources: 
 North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofboston.org/event/elf-hd-film/
