BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Samson et Dalila
DTSTART:20261219T110000
DTEND:20261219T130000
DTSTAMP:20260914T170850Z
UID:608b0e5e68cb8438aaf381f156a451@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Music by Camille Saint-Saëns | Libretto by Ferdinand Lemaire 
 Saint-Saëns’s spectacular take on the biblical hero of legendary streng
 th and the seductive Philistine whose beauty overpowers him returns in the
  Met’s larger-than-life production. Featuring a massive orchestra and ch
 orus and some of opera’s most spellbinding tunes\, this masterpiece is a
  feast for the eyes and ears. Giacomo Sagripanti conducts an electrifying 
 cast led by the formidable star pairing of mezzosoprano Aigul Akhmetshina 
 and tenor Clay Hilley\, transmitted live to cinemas worldwide. Conductor: 
 Giacomo Sagripanti Production: Darko Tresnjak Dalila: Aigul Akhmetshina Se
 t Designer: Alexander Dodge Samson: Clay Hilley Costume Designer: Linda Ch
 o High Priest of Dagon: Quinn Kelsey Lighting Designer: Donald Holder Abim
 élech: Alfred Walker Choreographer Austin McCormick Old Hebrew: Morris Ro
 binson C. Graham Berwind\, III Chorus Director: Tilman Michael\n\nSources:
  North of Boston\nEvent page: https://northofboston.org/event/samson-et-da
 lila/
LOCATION:Shalin Liu Performance Center\, 37 Main Street\, Rockport\, MA\, 
 01966
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/samson-et-dalila/
END:VEVENT
